<translate>
==== FillFromDispenserSound ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Specifies the sound that will be played when water is poured into the item from the dispenser.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
FillFromDispenserSound = GetWaterFromDispenserPlasticMedium,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

